<ConceptLayout concept="shiro" title="Urushi concept 02 — Shiro-urushi">
  <header class="concept-nav shell">
    <a class="concept-brand" href="/">urushi</a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="#system">System</a><a href="/docs/">Documentation</a><a class="nav-mark" href="/docs/">Read the docs ↗</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="shiro-hero shell">
      <p class="concept-kicker">02 / Shiro-urushi / 白漆</p>
      <h1>Terminal interfaces,<br /><em>composed as one.</em></h1>
      <div class="shiro-deck"><p>Urushi is a presentation foundation for Rust terminal applications.</p><p>Use the surface your application needs. Keep the visual language it deserves.</p></div>
      <div class="shiro-meta"><span>Styled output</span><span>CLI</span><span>Prompts</span><span>TUI</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="shiro-feature shell">
      <div class="shiro-terminal" aria-label="Styled terminal output preview"><header><span>Example 01</span><span>urushi-cli</span></header><div><p><b>✓</b> Release prepared</p><dl><dt>Package</dt><dd>urushi</dd><dt>Version</dt><dd>0.1.0</dd><dt>Profile</dt><dd>release</dd></dl><footer>Theme → View → stdout</footer></div></div>
      <div class="shiro-feature-copy"><span class="large-index">01</span><h2>The terminal changes.<br />The presentation model doesn’t.</h2><p>Plain output, blocking prompts, and application loops stay independent. Theme, composition, and layout remain coherent.</p><a href="/docs/">Explore the model →</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="shiro-system shell" id="system">
      <header><p>System / 04 surfaces</p><h2>Use only what you need.</h2></header>
      <ol><li><span>01</span><strong>Styled text</strong><p>Terminal-aware rendering</p></li><li><span>02</span><strong>CLI presentation</strong><p>Semantic output patterns</p></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Prompts</strong><p>Input and validation flows</p></li><li><span>04</span><strong>Full-screen TUI</strong><p>Runtime and adapters</p></li></ol>
    </section>
    <section class="shiro-quote shell"><blockquote>Share presentation.<br />Not control flow.</blockquote><div><code>cargo add urushi</code><a class="solid-action" href="/docs/">Get started →</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="concept-footer shell"><span>urushi</span><p>Concept 02 / Shiro-urushi</p><a href="/designs/raden/">Next concept →</a></footer>
</ConceptLayout>
